{"id":"en_the-ask-out-hitman","title":"The Ask-out Hitman","titleEn":"The Ask-out Hitman","description":"Mu-ryuk is driven by a desire to avenge his boss, and after witnessing Gogong’s bold confession attack, he finds himself inspired, wishing he could approach his own boss with the same daring. He seeks Gogong’s guidance and begins training to execute the ideal confession attack. Yet the plan does not unfold smoothly. Gogong’s repeated rejections have instead earned him a reputation as a seasoned expert in the field. In the end, the confession attempts succeed in persuading his boss to go out with him.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ask-out-hitman/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ask-out-hitman/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"featured":true,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77moja/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-ask-out-hitman_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77moja/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ask-out-hitman_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77moja/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ask-out-hitman_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77moja/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ask-out-hitman_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v77moja/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ask-out-hitman_5","title":"Episode 5","season":